---
import CaseStudyLayout from '../../layouts/CaseStudyLayout.astro';
---

<CaseStudyLayout
  title="Legacy Library Modernization"
  subtitle="Recovery and modernization of a large bibliographic catalog from discontinued legacy software into a modern digital library."
  eyebrow="Confidential Project · Case Study"
  stack={['Python', 'Omeka', 'ETL', 'Legacy Systems', 'Automation']}
  confidential={true}
>
  <div class="case-grid">
    <article class="case-panel">
      <h2>Legacy Recovery</h2>
      <p>
        The original catalog depended on discontinued tooling that required a Windows XP
        virtual machine for export. A custom Python pipeline parsed, normalized and preserved
        the legacy bibliographic data for migration.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="case-panel">
      <h2>Data Migration</h2>
      <p>
        The recovery pipeline repaired legacy encodings, mapped bibliographic fields into a
        modern MARC-like structure and preserved raw source fields for traceability and future migrations.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="case-panel">
      <h2>Media Automation</h2>
      <p>
        A separate workflow processes exported WhatsApp media, associates photos with inventory
        numbers and supports bulk linking of book images to catalog records, reducing thousands
        of manual operations to a batch process.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</CaseStudyLayout>
